OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fand drizzle for some first thing.
OL,7,FTurning brighter and very warm during
OL,8,Fthe middle part of the day with a
OL,9,Fgentle southeasterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy and turning breezy
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain or dizzle
OL,13,Fduring the second half of the night.
OL,14,FStaying unusually warm overnight for
OL,15,Fthis time of year.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FRain and cloud clear to
OL,18,Fgive some sunny spells. Showers
OL,19,Fdeveloping later in the afternoon.
OL,20,FWind easing compared to the morning.
OL,21,FSlightly cooler compared to Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
